#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0147B expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "PARAMN is the TARGET here, so row 3's blank PARAMN is excluded from the Albumin group's distinct-value count and from the flag pass: one distinct non-blank value survives and nothing fires. Same column as PMDA-AD0146B's blank-key fixture, different mechanism."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col PARAM   type=Char
col PARAMN  type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | ALB | Albumin | 1
S1 | 002 | ALB | Albumin | 1
S1 | 003 | ALB | Albumin |
